<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Contact & Corrections | World Food Crisis</title><meta name="description" content="Report an error, suggest a topic or flag a source that needs updating."><link rel="canonical" href="https://worldfoodcrisis.pages.dev/contact/"><meta name="robots" content="index,follow"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/site.css"><script is:inline src="/assets/main.js" defer></script></head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a><div class="topline"><div class="container topline-inner"><span>Independent food-system explainers</span><span>Facts before fear.</span></div></div><header class="site-header"><div class="container header-inner"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">F<span>+</span></span><span class="brand-words"><strong>World Food Crisis</strong><small>Facts before fear.</small></span></a><button class="nav-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="primary-nav"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span class="sr-only">Open navigation</span></button><nav class="primary-nav" id="primary-nav"><a href="/#analysis">Analysis</a><a href="/data/">Data desk</a><a href="/#guides">Practical guides</a><a href="/about/">About</a></nav></div></header><main id="main"><header class="page-hero"><div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><span>Contact & Corrections</span></nav><h1>Contact & Corrections</h1><p>Report an error, suggest a topic or flag a source that needs updating.</p></div></header><div class="container page-content page-content-narrow"><h2>Corrections matter</h2><p>If you find a numerical error, broken citation or outdated forecast, please include the page URL, exact claim and a primary source supporting the correction.</p><h2>Topic suggestions</h2><p>We welcome reader questions about food prices, crop production, food trade, fertilizer, storage, climate risk, household budgets and food security.</p><h2>Contact method</h2><p>A monitored public editorial address has not yet been configured for this launch build. Before publication, the site owner should add and test a working contact address or privacy-conscious form. We do not display a fabricated address.</p><p>For urgent food assistance, contact relevant local authorities or established humanitarian organizations; this site is not an emergency response service.</p></div></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="container footer-main"><div class="footer-brand"><a class="brand brand-footer" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">F<span>+</span></span><span class="brand-words"><strong>World Food Crisis</strong><small>Facts before fear.</small></span></a><p>Independent explainers on food availability, prices and food security.</p></div><div class="footer-col"><strong>Explore</strong><a href="/data/">Data desk</a><a href="/sources/">Sources</a><a href="/methodology/">Methodology</a></div><div class="footer-col"><strong>About</strong><a href="/about/">Our purpose</a><a href="/contact/">Corrections & contact</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></div></div><div class="container footer-bottom"><span>© <span data-year>2026</span> World Food Crisis</span><span>Sources over speculation.</span></div></footer></body></html>